# notlogi
===
 NotLogi: unofficial mouse & keyboard tools for Linux. For Logitech MX Master 4 and 3S and MX Keys: an action ring around the pointer, MX Master 4 haptics and haptic panel, buttons, gestures, thumb wheel, SmartShift, DPI, smart backlight, Bluetooth pairing and per-application profiles.
